# The tools `build_registry` adds beyond `register_all`, as `name grade spawn-class`
# (src/tools/golden_tests.rs holds it; the classes are in yantrik-companion-tools/src/golden.rs).
# A tool that is added, missing or regraded fails the test: read its spawn, then change its line.
#
# create_automation, run_automation, spawn_agents and run_recipe start no program themselves: the
# tools they call later go through the registry, run_background included (it is `mind_command`:
# the task manager builds its shell with spawn::mind_command). telegram_send runs curl by a literal.
brain_status standard none
calendar_create_event standard none
calendar_delete_event standard none
calendar_list_events safe none
calendar_today safe none
calendar_update_event standard none
cancel_schedule standard none
cancel_task standard none
check_background_task safe none
check_bond safe none
complete_task standard none
create_automation standard none
create_inside_joke standard none
create_recipe standard none
create_schedule standard none
deduplicate_results safe none
delete_automation standard none
download_file standard none
extract_search_results safe none
find_recipe safe none
forget_commitment standard none
forget_topic standard none
form_opinion standard none
github_profile safe none
github_repos safe none
github_stars safe none
http_fetch safe none
introspect safe none
life_search standard none
list_automations safe none
list_background_tasks safe none
list_recipes safe none
list_schedules safe none
list_tasks safe none
queue_task standard none
rank_results safe none
recall safe none
recall_preferences safe none
relate_entities standard none
remember standard none
resolve_loop standard none
run_automation standard none
run_background sensitive mind_command
run_recipe standard none
save_user_fact standard none
search_sources standard none
set_reminder standard none
show_open_loops safe none
snooze_loop standard none
spawn_agents standard none
stop_background_task sensitive none
telegram_send standard fixed
toggle_automation standard none
update_schedule standard none
update_task standard none
web_fetch safe none
whatsapp_send standard none
